## Project Objectives

Development of a modular, cost-effective small satellite bus platform (50-300 kg class) for commercial and government customers requiring rapid deployment of earth observation, communication, and technology demonstration missions.

### Key Deliverables
1. StarLiner-100 bus (50-100 kg)
2. StarLiner-300 bus (150-300 kg)
3. Modular payload interfaces
4. Ground segment software
5. Production capability: 24 units/year

