## Technical Specifications

### StarLiner-100

| Parameter | Specification |
|-----------|---------------|
| Mass Range | 50-100 kg |
| Payload Mass | Up to 35 kg |
| Payload Power | Up to 80 W (avg) |
| Design Life | 5 years |
| Propulsion | Electric (optional) |
| Downlink | S-band, X-band |

### StarLiner-300

| Parameter | Specification |
|-----------|---------------|
